    "raw": "Given:\n- 2 quiches at $15.00 each\n- 6 croissants at $3.00 each\n- 6 buttermilk biscuits at $2.00 each\n- 10% discount on orders over $50.00\n\nFirst, calculate the total cost of the order:\n- Cost of quiches: 2 * $15.00 = $30.00\n- Cost of croissants: 6 * $3.00 = $18.00\n- Cost of buttermilk biscuits: 6 * $2.00 = $12.00\n\nTotal cost before discount: $30.00 + $18.00 + $12.00 = $60.00\n\nSince the total is over $50.00, a 10% discount applies:\n- Discount amount: 10% of $60.00 = 0.10 * $60.00 = $6.00\n\nTotal cost after discount: $60.00 - $6.00 = $54.00\n\nFINAL: 54",
